{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12311970","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12311970","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1231197001:1":{"text":"いや、大型船に積む救命ボートを用意してるんだ。","source_cn":"不，我们在准备给出海大船准备的救生艇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE73B35B6271B5BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1231197002:1":{"text":"港の封鎖が解除されて、大型船の船長がこぞって救命ボートの追加を依頼してきてるんだよ。","source_cn":"自从码头解封后，很多大船船长都下达了增加救生艇的命令。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D1F2907D63CFE9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1231197003:1":{"text":"海獣に遭遇した大型船が危険に晒された時、救命ボートが足りなくてパニックや争いが起きたらしいんだ。","source_cn":"据说不少遭遇海怪的大船遇险时，因为救生艇数量不够引起了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E70E078DAD722F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1231197004:1":{"text":"もう二度と同じことが起きないでほしいもんだ。","source_cn":"希望这批救生艇配备后，海员不会再重蹈覆辙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A29498D13E3CAB1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:码头工人巴拿马":{"text":"作業員のバナマ","source":"码头工人巴拿马","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}